---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Key ideas
description: Questions and takeaways from the passkeys talk.
permalink: /notes/
---

<section class="site-shell content-section">
  <p class="eyebrow">Takeaways</p>
  <h1>Key ideas</h1>
  <p class="lede">Short answers to the questions people usually ask once passkeys move from “nice login feature” to “different authentication primitive.”</p>

  {% for slide in talk.slides %}
    {% set publicNotes = slide.notes | publicNotes %}
    {% if publicNotes %}
      <section class="content-panel notes-panel" aria-labelledby="notes-slide-{{ slide.number }}">
        <h2 id="notes-slide-{{ slide.number }}"><a href="{{ slide | slidePath | url }}">Slide {{ slide.number }}: {{ slide.title }}</a></h2>
        {% for note in publicNotes %}
          <aside class="note-callout">
            <strong>{{ note.title }}:</strong> {{ note.body }}
          </aside>
        {% endfor %}
      </section>
    {% endif %}
  {% endfor %}
</section>
